<%# One session on Your board v2: the Last Touched card, with a drag handle beside
    it. The card is `sessions/session_card_frame` itself, not a copy, so the two
    views show a session the same way and stay that way.

    The handle and the data board-v2 sorts and counts by live on this wrapper,
    outside the card's <turbo-frame>. Anything that replaces the frame (Restart's
    reply, for one) redraws the card and leaves the handle and the category
    placement alone.

    `data-visibility-wrapper` tells the visibility controller to take this
    wrapper with the card when Snooze or Hide takes the card off the board, so no
    empty handle is left behind. Trash takes it by id (`board_v2_row_dom_id`).

    Locals:
      agent_session - the session %>
<li id="<%= board_v2_row_dom_id(agent_session) %>"
    class="relative flex min-w-0 items-stretch sm:gap-1.5"
    data-visibility-wrapper
    data-board-v2-target="row"
    data-session-id="<%= agent_session.id %>"
    data-last-touched="<%= agent_session.last_user_activity_at.to_f %>">
  <%# The grip. SortableJS only starts a drag from inside it, so it has to read
      as something to grab: a grey tab the card's full height, with the dots in
      the middle. On a wide screen it is a column beside the card. On a phone a
      column would cost the card the width its header needs, so the tab is laid
      over the card's own 16px left padding instead.

      `touch-none` hands a touch that starts here to the drag rather than to
      the page's scroll, which iOS would otherwise claim before SortableJS's
      hold delay runs out. %>
  <span class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 z-10 flex w-4 shrink-0 cursor-grab touch-none select-none items-center justify-center rounded-l-lg bg-gray-100 text-gray-500 hover:bg-gray-200 hover:text-gray-700 active:cursor-grabbing sm:static sm:w-6 sm:rounded-lg"
        data-board-v2-target="handle"
        aria-hidden="true"
        title="Drag to move this session to another category">
    <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 4a1 1 0 100 2 1 1 0 000-2zm6 0a1 1 0 100 2 1 1 0 000-2zM7 9a1 1 0 100 2 1 1 0 000-2zm6 0a1 1 0 100 2 1 1 0 000-2zm-6 5a1 1 0 100 2 1 1 0 000-2zm6 0a1 1 0 100 2 1 1 0 000-2z"/></svg>
  </span>
  <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
    <%= render "sessions/session_card_frame", agent_session: agent_session %>
  </div>
</li>
